// Forest: a clearing in a deep forest with a brook, through the seasons, rain and snow, wind and
// the time of day, set with the sliders of the panel (H hides it). Fly with the camera controller.
//
// The forest library (forest/library) brings the state the sliders write, the materials, the
// bark, leaves and trees, the undergrowth, the boulders, the sky and light and the HUD. This
// scene adds one file per concern in forest/: the layout functions that place things, the
// floor, the ground, the brook, the stands the trees grow in, the undergrowth scattered on the
// floor, the air (light shafts, mist over the brook and motes), and the view.
include ui/widgets
include forest/library
include forest/layout
include forest/floor
include forest/ground
include forest/brook
include forest/stands
include forest/scatter
include forest/atmosphere
include forest/view

using box.view

$ {
  box.app.FpsTarget: {60}
  Scene: {
    reflections: true,
    environment: true,
    aerial_perspective: true,
    cookies: true,
    alpha_cutout: true,
    blend_modes: true,
    texture_blend: true,
    texture_layers: true,
    triplanar: true,
    diffuse_transmission: true,
    texture_scroll: true,
    water: true,
    planar_reflections: true
  }
}
